1
00:00:14,856 --> 00:00:17,852
Tu habites dans cet immeuble ?
Do you live in this building?

2
00:00:17,952 --> 00:00:23,252
Oui, j’habite au troisième étage, dans un appartement.
Yes, I live on the third floor, in an apartment.

3
00:00:23,352 --> 00:00:26,252
Il y a un ascenseur ?
Is there an elevator?

4
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:30,428
Oui, et j’ai aussi un petit balcon.
Yes, and I also have a small balcony.

5
00:00:30,528 --> 00:00:33,332
Ton voisin est gentil ?
Is your neighbor nice?

6
00:00:33,432 --> 00:00:40,964
Oui, il est gentil. Je loue cet appartement, et le loyer est raisonnable.
Yes, he is nice. I rent this apartment, and the rent is reasonable.

7
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:44,108
Tu vas déménager bientôt ?
Are you going to move soon?

8
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:47,420
Non, je reste ici !
No, I’m staying here!
